SUMMARY:PlayLab Open Play
DESCRIPTION:Bring your little ones for drop-in fun! Drop-in for crafts\, sensory exploration\, open-ended play\, and so much fun! Best suited to kids ages 0-5\, though all are welcome. Children must be accompanied by an adult. \n*Located in the basement of Immanuel Lutheran Church \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/playlab-open-play/2026-04-30/
LOCATION:OR
CATEGORIES:Arts/Crafts,Books/Library,Educational,Family Fun,Inclusive,Indoor,Indoor Play Park,Kids Calendar,LGBTQ+,Playgroup,Storytime
